    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cJune\u300d is a horror adventure game in which you explore a haunted apartment and solve puzzles and try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world drawn with 2D pixel art,join the adventure of the main character, June, and her five companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion has a special ability such as &quot;glowing&quot;, &quot;floating&quot;, or &quot;smelling&quot;,you can use it by switching the controlled character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645270/extras/1891ea160f50ba4d5c19a2ebdd1d8059.avif?t=1748468997\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a spooky yet comical world,uncover the mysteries hidden in the past.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300cJune\u300d is a horror adventure game in which you explore a haunted apartment and solve puzzles and try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world drawn with 2D pixel art,join the adventure of the main character, June, and her five companions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each companion has a special ability such as &quot;glowing&quot;, &quot;floating&quot;, or &quot;smelling&quot;,you can use it by switching the controlled character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645270/extras/1891ea160f50ba4d5c19a2ebdd1d8059.avif?t=1748468997\" width=800 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a spooky yet comical world,uncover the mysteries hidden in the past.</p>",
    "short_description": "\u300cJune\u300d is a horror adventure game in which you explore a haunted apartment and solve puzzles and try to escape. Use your companions' special actions at key points,and let's return to our world alive.",
